{
  "id": "1SA.8",
  "number": "8",
  "bookId": "1SA",
  "reference": "1 Samwiri 8",
  "copyright": "Biblica® Bayibuli Entukuvu, Endagaano Enkadde nʼEndagaano Empya ekwatiddwa ku katambi™ Obwannannyini© 1984, 1986, 1993, 2014 bwa Biblica, Inc. Biblica® Open Luganda Contemporary Bible™ Copyright © 1984, 1986, 1993, 2014 by Biblica, Inc. \"Biblica\" Linnya ery'obwannannyini eryawandiisibwa Biblica mu Amerika era nga balina n'ekkakkalabozo, Inc. Bwaweebwa olukusa okulikozesa. \"Biblica\" is a trademark registered in the United States Patent and Trademark Office by Biblica, Inc. Used with permission.",
  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "8",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abayisirayiri Basaba Kabaka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samwiri bwe yakaddiwa, n'alonda batabani be okuba abalamuzi ba Isirayiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erinnya lya mutabani we omukulu ye yali Yoweeri, n'owokubiri nga ye Abiya, ne balamulanga mu Beeruseba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye batabani be ne batagoberera mpisa ze, ne bakyama ne banoonya amagoba, ne balya enguzi, era nga tebalamula mu bwenkanya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo abakadde bonna aba Isirayiri ne bakuŋŋaana ne bajja eri Samwiri e Laama,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne bamugamba nti, \"Laba, okaddiye ne batabani bo tebagoberera mpisa zo, kaakano tulondere kabaka anaatukulemberanga, tubeere ng'amawanga amalala gonna.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye bwe baayogera nti, \"Tuwe kabaka anaatukulemberanga,\" ne kitasanyusa Samwiri. Samwiri n'asaba eri",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.8.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.8.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.8.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.8.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'agamba Samwiri nti, \"Wuliriza ebigambo byonna abantu bye bakugamba. Tebajeemedde ggwe, naye bajeemedde nze nneme kuba kabaka waabwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okusinziira ku bikolwa byabwe okuva ku lunaku lwe nabaggya mu Misiri okutuusa ku lunaku lwa leero, bwe banjeemera, ne baweereza bakatonda abalala, nawe bwe batyo bwe bakuyisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaakano bawulirize, naye obalabulire ddala, era obategeeze ebintu byonna kabaka anaabafuga by'alibakola.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Samwiri n'ategeeza abantu abaali bamusaba kabaka, ebigambo byonna",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.8.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.8.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bye yamugamba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'abagamba nti, \"Bino bye bintu kabaka alibafuga by'alibakola: alitwala batabani bammwe n'abafuula abagoba ab'amagaali ge n'abeebagazi ab'embalaasi ze, n'abamu okuddukiranga mu maaso ag'amagaali ge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abamu ku bo alibafuula abaduumizi b'enkumi, n'abalala n'abafuula abaduumizi b'ataano, n'abalala okumulimiranga ennimiro ze n'okuzikungulanga, n'abalala okuweesanga ebyokulwanyisa n'ebintu eby'amagaali ge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alitwala bawala bammwe, okumuteekerateekera ebyakaloosa, n'okumufumbiranga, n'okumukoleranga emigaati.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alitwala ennimiro zammwe ennungi, n'ennimiro zammwe ez'emizabbibu n'ez'emizeeyituuni, n'aziwa abaweereza be.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alitwala ekimu eky'ekkumi eky'emmere yammwe ey'empeke, n'eky'ennimiro zammwe ez'emizabbibu, n'akigabira abakungu be n'abaweereza be.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alitwala abaweereza bammwe abasajja n'abaweereza bammwe abakazi, n'abavubuka bammwe abasinga obulungi n'endogoyi, n'abyeddiza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alitwala ekimu eky'ekkumi ku bisibo byammwe, mmwe n'abafuula abaweereza be.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Luliba lumu, mulyekkokkola kabaka wammwe gwe mwerondera, naye",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.8.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.8.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "talibafaako ku lunaku olwo.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye abantu ne bagaana okuwuliriza Samwiri, ne boogera nti, \"Nedda! Twagala kabaka okutufuga,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naffe tubeere ng'amawanga amalala gonna, nga tulina kabaka atufuga ayinza okutukulembera n'atulwanira entalo zaffe.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Samwiri bwe yawulira ebigambo byonna eby'abantu, n'abiddiramu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.8.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.8.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.8.22",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.8.22"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'addamu Samwiri nti, \"Bawulirize obalondere kabaka.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1SA 8:22"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Awo Samwiri n'agamba abantu ba Isirayiri nti, \"Buli omu ku mmwe addeyo ewuwe.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.8.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
